# LAMMPS Input Script for BCC Lattice of Iron

units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice bcc 2.87
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

mass 1 55.84

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

# Output settings
write_data structure.xyz
